      "text": "Original transcript, explicit task notes, session identity, and each reply's provider/model.\nThe next request uses the new model's context budget; full history may not fit.\nCancelling the stop/switch confirmation keeps the current request running.\nCredentials are resolved at runtime and never stored in switch events.",
